OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do voters in Holborn and St
OL,4,APancras want?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe by-election in Holborn and St
OL,7,FPancras will be held on Thursday.
OL,9,FVoters in the constituency will be
OL,10,Fselecting a new MP to replace Sir Keir
OL,11,FStarmer, who resigned from the House of
OL,12,FCommons at the start of September.
OL,14,FThere are 15 candidates in the
OL,15,Fby-election who have spent weeks
OL,16,Fspeaking to potential constituents and
OL,17,Fputting leaflets through letterboxes.
OL,19,FWhat do the voters make of the contest,
OL,20,Fand what are the issues that concern
OL,21,Fthem? BBC London went to Holborn and St
OL,22,FPancras to find out.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
